	"_comment": "LOFTREACH - sky islands. Grassy islets float in open sky (3400 x 2600), joined by rope bridges, with windmills, kites and a sea of cloud drifting below. The 'sky' block IS the world: islands (closed outlines: the turf, and the fence you cannot walk past, see SkyRealm), bridges (walkable strips; one is hidden until your companion has seen it from above), the windmill and kites, and 'picture' (the high clouds that make an arrow, seen only from far up). Eight islands (Anchor Landing where you arrive, Millstone Lea, Kite Green, Cloud Orchard, Vane Hill, Pennant Crag, Lantern Pasture, High Perch) and an islet you cannot walk to (The Rookery). It RE-SKINS ITSELF through its 'art' block (deep-merged over data/art.json): its own turf, rock, trees (tree entries [x, y, kind]: round/oak/birch/pine/blossom/fruit/gold). Its secret is a nest: see the 'secret' block (reveal type 'skyview'). Generated by tools/gen_loftreach_world.py (art: pokepals/tools/gen_loftreach.py) - edit that and re-run, don't hand-tune positions.",
